{:rec/vertical [:vertical/id :vertical/isic-6399] :rec/band-low 50000.0 :rec/band-high 150000.0 :rec/unit "¥/board/月 (managed hosting)" :rec/rationale "The 6 surveyed multi-tenant job-board comparables (JobBoard.io $449-649/mo, JBoard $249-849/mo, Madgex $500+/mo) convert at ~¥150/$ to roughly ¥37k-127k+/月, validating business-model.md's existing 'illustrative' ¥50k-150k/月 managed-community-board band rather than requiring a revision. The 職業安定法5条の4 governed audit ledger is a differentiator none of the 6 competitors (US/UK/JP) offer, supporting the top of the band for 届出事業者-grade regulated boards. The free-then-monetize funnel is independently validated in both markets (WP Job Manager's free core; engage's free board-creation + paid ticketed distribution) — confirming AGPL self-host as a legitimate zero-cost top-of-funnel, not just a design choice unique to cloud-itonami." :rec/run-id "pricing-intel-20260716-02" :rec/at "2026-07-16" :rec/seq 125}

